        "answer": "Allocate an ArenaEventTimerSmallEndsIn element, set its class/id/default sound, queue a pending state update, then attach EventEndsIn text. Text uses T8__OCHRE, the exact Engine hash/localization key menu/new, dinnext_regular, spacing 1 and two ordered alignment calls. Register the two named state-condition pointers. Invoke PostLoadFunc(self, controller, menu) only if its current value is truthy, then return self. The two condition implementations are excluded nested source obligations.",
